COMPANY_FOUNDED_TEXT:"Gamers, nerds, moms, dads, engineers, designers, marketers, support. Discord is a small group of passionate gamers whose mission is to bring people together around games. Diversity and inclusiveness are a critical part of how we get there. We believe that with diversity comes a better product, better decisions, and a better work environment. Everyone here is committed to making Discord representative of the world we want to live and play in.",COMPANY_HERO_HEADING:"We built Discord to bring gamers together",COMPANY_HERO_TEXT:"The best relationships in our lives were built around playing games. Memories of staying up late playing Warcraft 3 with friends or sharing creations in The Sims mean so much to us. Discord's free voice and text chat is about making it easier for you to spend time with the people you care about, create these memories, and land a headshot or two.",COMPANY_HIRING_BUTTON:"Check out our open positions",
COMPANY_HIRING_HEADING:'Come make some Discord in "Sunny" San Francisco',COMPANY_HIRING_TEXT:"Become part of a passionate group of gamers passionate about passionately crafting exceptional products they’re passionate about. Whew.",COMPANY_INVESTORS_HEADING:"Some of the smartest investors believe in us",COMPANY_INVESTORS_TEXT:"We've raised over {fundingAmount} from top VCs in the valley like Greylock, Benchmark, and Tencent. In other words, we'll be around for a while.",COMPANY_PRESS_HEADING:"We’ll just leave these here...",COMPANY_PRESS_TEXT_1:'"Honestly, Discord is just killing it from their tech to their people. Excited to see what comes next."',COMPANY_PRESS_SOURCE_1:"Top Twitch Streamer",COMPANY_PRESS_TEXT_2:'"Our close knit community wouldn\'t have been made possible without Discord - it was the perfect tool to bring our community to the next level."',COMPANY_PRESS_SOURCE_2:"/r/overwatch mod",
COMPANY_PRESS_TEXT_3:"\"Discord is an increasingly big deal and it's worth your time to take a look if you're seeking more ways to connect with the communities around the games you play.\"",COMPANY_STATS_HEADING:"A lot of people use Discord",COMPANY_STATS_TEXT:"And a lot of them use it every day",COMPANY_STATS_TEXT_1:"Monthly players",COMPANY_STATS_TEXT_2:"Peak current players",COMPANY_STATS_TEXT_3:"Messages sent a day",COMPANY_TWEETS_HEADING:"People really <3 us too",COMPANY_TWEETS_LINK_1:"https://twitter.com/RivalEsportsGG/status/864916530286411776",COMPANY_TWEETS_LINK_2:"https://twitter.com/sn0wbirdtbh/status/864934396373151745",COMPANY_TWEETS_LINK_3:"https://twitter.com/lovelessashi/status/864953511850594304",COMPANY_TWEETS_NAME_1:"Pro Rivalry League",COMPANY_TWEETS_NAME_2:"snowbird",COMPANY_TWEETS_NAME_3:"Princess Ashley",COMPANY_TWEETS_TEXT:"You don't need to look much farther than our [Twitter stream]({link}) to see the sentiment",
COMPANY_TWEETS_TEXT_1:"Discord has helped us run our organization, make new friends, and experience unforgettable moments. We couldn't do without it.",COMPANY_TWEETS_TEXT_2:"Discord is the most stable VOIP service available. Its intuitive and customizable design offers top of the line service for any community.",COMPANY_TWEETS_TEXT_3:"Discord has wonderful uptime, quality sound, amazing features, simplicity, customizable, seamless, gaming overlay, quick bug fixes, awesome PR, and more.",COMPANY_TWEETS_USERNAME_1:"RivalEsportsGG",COMPANY_TWEETS_USERNAME_2:"sn0wbirdtbh",COMPANY_TWEETS_USERNAME_3:"lovelessashi",COMPANY_REFRESH_HIRING_HEADING:"Come make some Discord with us",COMPANY_REFRESH_HIRING_BUTTON_2:"Open Jobs",COMPANY_REFRESH_HIRING_TEXT_2:" Become part of a group of passionate people passionately crafting exceptional products they’re passionate about. We’re also passionate about health and safety, so you’ll be kicking it from your couch while our office is closed.",
COMPANY_REFRESH_METRICS_MONTHLY_ACTIVE_USERS_VALUE:"150 Million",COMPANY_REFRESH_METRICS_MONTHLY_ACTIVE_USERS_LABEL:"Monthly active users",COMPANY_REFRESH_METRICS_WEEKLY_ACTIVE_SERVERS_VALUE:"19 Million",COMPANY_REFRESH_METRICS_WEEKLY_ACTIVE_SERVERS_LABEL:"Active servers per week",COMPANY_REFRESH_METRICS_DAILY_SERVER_CONVERSATION_MINUTES_VALUE:"4 Billion",COMPANY_REFRESH_METRICS_DAILY_SERVER_CONVERSATION_MINUTES_LABEL:"Server conversation minutes daily",COMPANY_REBRAND_METADATA_TITLE:"About Discord | Our Mission and Values",COMPANY_REBRAND_METADATA_DESCRIPTION:"Our mission is create space for everyone to find belonging. We're building an easy-to-use communication service that gives people a place to talk, build relationships, and create that space.",COMPANY_REBRAND_HERO_TITLE_2:"Create space for everyone to find belonging",
COMPANY_REBRAND_HERO_SUBTITLE_2:"It’s where your world hangs out. Discord is a voice, video and text communication service used by over a hundred million people to hang out and talk with their friends and communities.",COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_TITLE:"Our Story",COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_SUBTITLE:"Discord is about giving people the power to create space to find belonging in their lives. We want to make it easier for you to talk regularly with the people you care about. We want you to build genuine relationships with your friends and communities close to home or around the world. Original, reliable, playful, and relatable. These are the values that connect our users and our employees at Discord.",COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_BEGINNING_TITLE:"Prologue",
COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_BEGINNING:"Discord was started to solve a big problem: how to communicate with friends around the world while playing games online. Since childhood, founders Jason Citron and Stan Vishnevskiy both shared a love of video games, cherishing the friendships and connections that formed while playing them. At the time, all the tools built for this job were slow, unreliable, and complex. Jason and Stan knew they could make a better service that encouraged talking, helped form memories, and recreated the feeling of togetherness all found through gaming.",COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_START_TITLE:"Chapter One",
COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_START:"So, in 2015, Stan and Jason started to bring Discord to life. People from all over the world loved it. Discord made it easy to genuinely communicate with friends, going beyond casual talking. Friends were staying in touch with their various communities. Discord was making it easy to participate in conversation, hopping around text, voice and video to talk. The technology was complex but the goal was simple: make Discord an inviting and comfortable home to jump into with your communities and friends. Within a few years, Discord began to take off, and devoted people who loved our product sprung up around the world.",COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_TODAY_TITLE_2:"Where are we now?",
COMPANY_REBRAND_HISTORY_TODAY:"Discord is used by everyone from local hiking clubs, to art communities, to study groups. Discord has millions of people creating places for their friends and communities, talking for upwards of 4 hours per day on the platform. Discord is now where the world talks, hangs out, and builds relationships. Discord lets anyone create a space to find belonging—just like it did for Jason and Stan.",COMPANY_REBRAND_METRICS_TITLE:"Our metrics",COMPANY_REBRAND_OFFICES:"Our office",COMPANY_REBRAND_HIRING_HEADING:"Come make some Discord with us",COMPANY_REBRAND_HIRING_BUTTON_2:"Open Jobs",COMPANY_REBRAND_HIRING_TEXT_2:"Become part of a group of passionate people passionately crafting exceptional products they’re passionate about. We’re also passionate about health and safety, so you’ll be kicking it from your couch while our office is closed.",COMPANY_REBRAND_METRICS_MONTHLY_ACTIVE_USERS_VALUE:"150 Million",
