JOBS_REFRESH_FOOTER_SF_ONLY_FLEXIBLE_WORK_MODEL:"At Discord, we believe great work can happen anywhere, whether in person or virtually. Our flexible work model empowers our people to choose where they work best: at home, in one of our offices like our San Francisco HQ, or a mix of both. While we have no requirement to work from the office, we’re hiring most roles in the SF Bay Area to foster a vibrant central hub in the region. We're also committed to creating an in-office experience people genuinely want to be part of, with thoughtfully designed moments that bring teams together.",JOBS_REFRESH_FOOTER_SF_ONLY_FLEXIBLE_WORK_MODEL_SEP25:"Our flexible work model empowers our people to choose where they work best: at home, in one of our offices like our San Francisco HQ, or a mix of both. While we have no requirement to work from the office, we’re hiring most roles in the SF Bay Area to foster a vibrant central hub in the region.",
