LANDING_BLURB:"Discord is the easiest way to communicate over voice, video, and text, whether you’re part of a school club, a nightly gaming group, a worldwide art community, or just a handful of friends that want to hang out.",LANDING_TITLE:"A new way to chat with your communities and friends.",LANDING_BLURB_TREATMENT_1:"Discord is the #1 voice, video, and text chat for playing games with friends, near and far.\n  It’s fast, reliable, and works on both your desktop and phone.",LANDING_BLURB_TREATMENT_2:"Discord is the #1 voice, video, and text chat for playing games with friends, near and far.\n  It’s free, secure, and works on both your desktop and phone.",LANDING_TITLE_TREATMENT_1:"Free and secure group chat for gaming.",LANDING_TITLE_TREATMENT_2:"Connect around the things you care about.",LANDING_TITLE_TREATMENT_3:"A new way to hang out with friends online.",LANDING_TITLE_TREATMENT_4:"The coolest group chat app in the entire universe.",
